}

class Person <<lihat U5-B>>
class ChangeSource <<lihat U5-B>>
class ChangeType <<lihat U5-B>>
class Document <<lihat U5-F>>
class Model <<lihat U5-F>>

Change "*" -- "0..1" ChangeSource : pemicu, misalnya ECR >
Change "*" -- "1" ChangeType
Change "*" -- "0..1" Person : pemohon (atau service account) >
Change "*" -- "0..1" Person : verifikator, bukan pemohon (R-SEC-11) >
Change "1" *-- "1..*" ChangeDocument
ChangeDocument "*" -- "1" Document
